  "mapVerification": "All 97 published mapped routes retain original OSM way IDs, versions, tags and coordinates. Routes are matched by exact hole reference, and by physical nine name at Beekman. Ninety-three route endpoints fall inside mapped green polygons; the remaining four numbered routes agree with official pars and course position but their green polygons are absent or do not contain the endpoint. Beekman Highland 4 and Valley 4 have official illustrated scorecard coverage but no mapped route. Hudson Hills hole 18 retains the original route while documenting and validating its incorrect raw par tag against two published scorecards."
